    "preamble": "Vinod Ramchandra Gangwani vs The State Of Maharashtra on 25 January, 2024 Author: N. R. Borkar Bench: Anuja Prabhudessai, N. R. Borkar 22-wpst-183-24.doc In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Writ Petition (St) No. 183 Of 2024 Vinod R. Gangwani ...Petitioner Versus State of Maharashtra ...Respondent Mr. Tushar Sonawane a/w. Ms Pooja Satpute for the Petitioner.",
    "facts": "2. The petitioner seeks quashing of Fir No. 797 of 2023 registered at Kolsewadi Police Station, Thane city for ofences under Sections 188, 272, 273, 328 read with 34 of the Indian Penal Code and Sections 26(2)(i), 26(2)(a), 27(3)(c), 30(2) of the Food Safety and Standard Act, 2006.",
    "arguments": "3. Learned counsel for the petitioner states that the issue regarding applicability of Section 328 of the IPC is pending before the Hon'ble Supreme Court."
  },
